@startuml getOperationNameAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getOperationNameAsync – Retrieve Operation Name
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "Operation Client Interface" as oci #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
        - operationClientUuid 
end note

requestor -> oci: (operationClientUuid)
activate oci

oci -> jd: read logical-termination-point
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> oci: Operation Client LTP List
deactivate jd

 note over oci
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Locate op-client interface with matching operationClientUuid  
  - Extract operation-name attribute  
  - Return operationName if found  
  - Return undefined if no match exists or attribute missing
 end note

oci --> requestor: operationName | undefined
deactivate oci

@enduml
